: "1303763625108941", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/604317775_1303763628442274_419750303280897721_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=atUiJ8fVcncQ7kNvwGFrEr2&_nc_oc=AdrSSqICDzO_lKUASJItvdzglBZqocZphtKD1QC-jJlsbkXHU6_xlEcbfrZF7g3DNzk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRVTBJKLre26P_jivSDRIZRLPQq1GOldb6pIxsGgs3UkA&oe=6AF9B59B"}, {"file_name": "image-1790856060112.png", "id": "1755502859053741", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/595119480_1755502862387074_5724364352973696968_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=c-iWq21SqWsQ7kNvwGO14VL&_nc_oc=Adqlt6aU0fpaKelGsvcebLZFZa_PBP-3sjtCM8lFWvmaofmjMKKHWpn0KpiyYihLzC4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTVlhCJ-8l2XwJlOWn7FxiWNt7nhIvunO417oWpeIu0sA&oe=6AF9DE93"}, {"file_name": "image-1790856062524.png", "id": "1632354471846995", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/596168449_1632354475180328_6780694286156945874_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Fr6rhA4vfD8Q7kNvwEiQ2DM&_nc_oc=AdrlFHTifjgYOM2qzlr3dpBJYUqaBfxsPZuGlD8V8SuKsgDKhOl1AiQInlh3aIhY4qg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQScSHC0qwDrN3Xoklt0gjuuPQjUmwxP4KNnJRI4WRgCGA&oe=6AF9B8CE"}, {"file_name": "image-1790856051503.png", "id": "1131662959808368", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/673716021_1131662966475034_8434999150672613907_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=KnL867_smd8Q7kNvwH-uYWX&_nc_oc=Ado92DTmZet7yVX6kZnztSzgiqVHhQXUjAvENdDdiNrcu85LCWUZjXbs8LwO0RNCqPM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQ-ZoO0Wup4kZljgcBCxe_TyhN5H9lglyHw9p-1SPF1nA&oe=6AF9E05E"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "SpiderMonk", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Become the city's own hero.\n\nSpiderMonk puts you in the body of a web-slinging monkey in a city that never ends. Move the way you'd expect a monkey to: push off the ground and walls with your arms to run, jump and climb. Then fire a web and swing between skyscrapers at full speed.\n\nSWING LIKE YOU MEAN IT\nFire webs from either hand, reel in, let go at the top of the arc and fly. Spread your arms to glide, zip up a web, crawl up walls, and slam into the street for a superhero landing.\n\nFIGHT CRIME\nGangs are robbing the streets. Punch, dodge and counter with your own hands, wrap thugs up in webs, and clean up the city one crime at a time.\n\nPLAY WITH FRIENDS\nJoin a public room or make a private one with a code, then pick a game mode:\n\u2022 Casual: swing, explore and hang out\n\u2022 Venom Tag: one touch or one web and you're infected; the last one clean wins\n\u2022 PvP: fight your friends; first to 5 knockouts wins\n\u2022 Coin Rush: 3 minutes to grab the most coins\n\u2022 Floor Is Lava: the streets are burning; touch them and lose a life\n\nMAKE IT YOURS\nCollect coins across the city and spend them on suits, hats, face items, badges and web colours. Try them on in your apartment mirror.\n\nCOMFORT OPTIONS\nSnap turn, a comfort vignette, swing assist and a menu you can place wherever you like.\n\nOnline play requires an internet connection.", "short_description": "Swing through an endless city as a web-slinging monkey. Move with your arms Gorilla Tag-style, swing on webs, take down street gangs, and play tag, PvP and more with friends online."}]}, "developer_name": "VenWhy Studios", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/swingtopiapp/home", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Ven", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/swingtopia/home", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_FEW", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "528142316460358"}, {"id": "2710427532541308"}], "exte